y lead to the remediation of patching the service targetPort. | Would change my mind if: If logs from the productcatalogservice pod show severe, continuous application errors indicating an internal fault despite the healthy K8s state, or if metrics show high error rates/latency despite the port mismatch fix. This would suggest a compound issue or a different root cause. | Why: Checking logs for the healthy pod will help determine if the application itself is functioning correctly internally, or if there's a hidden runtime issue despite its 'Ready' status. This will confirm whether the service targetPort mismatch is the sole, or at least primary, root cause.",
